Depends: ${misc:Depends},
Description: Diagnostic Android capture probe APK built on OBS
 Standalone Android diagnostic package verifying MediaProjection and
 AudioPlaybackCapture permissions and lifecycle behavior for KDE Connect
 screenstream development. Contains an unsigned/debug-signed APK archive for
 manual ADB installation onto authorized test devices.
